WEBVTT

00:07:27.997 --> 00:07:30.797
About measuring up
to other people's expectation,

00:07:30.797 --> 00:07:33.063
that's a really, really important one,

00:07:33.063 --> 00:07:36.730
and I think it's critical to separate out

00:07:36.763 --> 00:07:40.397
what other people's
expectations are of you

00:07:40.430 --> 00:07:42.430
and what your own expectations are,

00:07:42.463 --> 00:07:44.763
what your own values are.

00:07:44.797 --> 00:07:48.030
And we care about

00:07:48.063 --> 00:07:51.197
what loved ones and other people
think about us,

00:07:51.230 --> 00:07:52.497
but ultimately,

00:07:53.430 --> 00:07:55.897
we want to be true to our own values

00:07:55.930 --> 00:08:01.230
and be sensitive to others
who may have different feelings,